<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Starwood Lodging started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Starwood Lodging started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Sand Brothers &amp; Co analyst Matthew Russo said he started coverage of Starwood Lodging Trust with a strong buy recommendation.</p>
<p>--Shares in the hotel and casino owner closed up 1/4 at 46-1/8 on Monday on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>--&quot;We estimate HOT's EBITDA/Share to grow approximately 27 percent during the next year, making it one of the fastest growing hotel REITs in the country,&quot; Russo said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
